vulkan-systems
  gpu/       generic VulkanEngine GPU resource management and compute
  render/    graphics pipelines, targets, mesh draws
  bvh/       GPU LBVH acceleration
  spatial/   CPU BVH index and frustum queries
  network/   nonblocking UDP and generic reliable message streaming
  jobs/      bounded multithreaded jobs and completion queue

Each module has independent build.c, minimal C++17 public API.
Root build.c exports VulkanSystems (gpu/render), VulkanSpatial, VulkanNetwork
and VulkanJobs as independent static-library targets. GPU modules depend
on VulkanEngine; network and jobs do not. The host manages GPU lifetime.
